  "definition": "Report Delivery; Recordkeeping",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-01-01",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Dw 800) #9730, eff 6-30-10; amd by #10771, eff 2-1-15 (from Env-Dw 811.22); ss by #12675, eff 1-1-19",
